<title>USA: Riverside Beaver CSD, Pa., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Riverside Beaver CSD, Pa., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $20 millio n of Riverside Beaver County School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Ser ies 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.588 percent without adjustment for the cost of insurance.</p>
</text>
